Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Localization|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	Then Page add
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add WC With Multiple Translations
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|LanguageUsecase#AddWCWithMultipleTranslations|
	When these properties
		|testray.component.names|Localization,Web Content Administration|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Add CP
	And WebContent add With Three Translations
	And PortletEntry publish
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Web Content Display|
	And WebContentDisplayPortlet select Web Content
		|webContentTitle|WC Title|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Language Selector|
	And Refresh
	And LanguagePortlet select Language PG
		|language|Spanish (Spain)|
	And Refresh
	And WebContent view PG Via WCD
		|webContentContent|WC Contenido|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletName|Visor de contenido web|
		|portletOption|Editar contenido web|
	And IFrame select Edit Asset Frame
	And WebContent select Locale
		|locale|es-ES|
	And WebContent view CP
		|webContentContent|WC Contenido|
		|webContentTitle|WC Titulo|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Refresh
	And LanguagePortlet select Language PG
		|language|German (Germany)|
	And Refresh
	And WebContent view PG Via WCD
		|webContentContent|WC Inhalt|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletName|Webcontentanzeige|
		|portletOption|Webcontent bearbeiten|
	And IFrame select Edit Asset Frame
	And WebContent select Locale
		|locale|de-DE|
	And WebContent view CP
		|webContentContent|WC Inhalt|
		|webContentTitle|WC Titel|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Refresh
	And LanguagePortlet select Language PG
		|language|Finnish (Finland)|
	And Refresh
	And WebContent view PG Via WCD
		|webContentContent|WC Pitoisuus|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletName|Web-sisällön esitys|
		|portletOption|Muokkaa web-sisältöä|
	And IFrame select Edit Asset Frame
	And WebContent select Locale
		|locale|fi-FI|
	Then WebContent view CP
		|webContentContent|WC Pitoisuus|
		|webContentTitle|WC Otsikko|
Scenario: Add WC With Translation
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|quarantine|
	When these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|LanguageUsecase#AddWCWithTranslation|
	And these properties
		|testray.component.names|Localization,Web Content Administration|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Add CP
	And WebContent add CP
		|webContentContent|WC Content|
		|webContentTitle|WC Title|
	And WebContent add Locale
		|language|Spanish (Spain)|
		|locale|es-ES|
	And WebContent add CP
		|webContentContent|WC Contenido|
		|webContentTitle|WC Titulo|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Content add PG
		|assetTitle|WC Title|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Language Selector|
	And LanguagePortlet select Language PG
		|language|Spanish (Spain)|
	And WebContent view PG Via WCD
		|webContentContent|WC Contenido|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletName|Visor de contenido web|
		|portletOption|Editar contenido web|
	And IFrame select Edit Asset Frame
	And WebContent select Locale
		|locale|es-ES|
	Then WebContent view CP
		|webContentContent|WC Contenido|
		|webContentTitle|WC Titulo|
Scenario: Move Current Languages To Available
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|LanguageUsecase#MoveCurrentLanguagesToAvailable|
	When these properties
		|testray.component.names|Localization|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Language Selector|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And LanguagePortlet move Languages To Available
	And LanguagePortlet move Languages To Current
		|currentLanguages|English (United States),German (Germany),Spanish (Spain)|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And LanguagePortlet view Languages Absent
		|missingLanguages|ARABIC,CHINESE,FRENCH,HUNGARIAN,JAPANESE,PORTUGUESE|
	Then LanguagePortlet view Languages Present
		|currentLanguages|ENGLISH,GERMAN,SPANISH|
Scenario: View Changed Default Portal Language Via Web Content
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|LanguageUsecase#ViewChangedDefaultPortalLanguageViaWebContent|
	When these properties
		|testray.component.names|Localization|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Instance Settings|
	And PortalSettings configure Current Languages CP
		|defaultPortalLanguage|Spanish (Spain)|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Add CP
	Then WebContent view Default Language
		|locale|es-ES|
Scenario: View Display Options Via Language Portlet
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|LanguageUsecase#ViewDisplayOptionsViaLanguagePortlet|
	When these properties
		|testray.component.names|Localization|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Language Selector|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And LanguagePortlet toggle Display Template
		|displayStyle|Icon Menu|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And LanguagePortlet view Display Template Icon Menu
		|language|Deutsch|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And LanguagePortlet toggle Display Template
		|displayStyle|Long Text|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And LanguagePortlet view Display Template Long Text
		|language|suomi|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And LanguagePortlet toggle Display Template
		|displayStyle|Select Box|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And LanguagePortlet view Display Template Select Box
		|language|English|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And LanguagePortlet toggle Display Template
		|displayStyle|Short Text|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	Then LanguagePortlet view Display Template Short Text
		|languageKey|HU|
Scenario: View Removed Current Portal Languages Via Language Portlet
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|LanguageUsecase#ViewRemovedCurrentPortalLanguagesViaLanguagePortlet|
	When these properties
		|testray.component.names|Localization|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Language Selector|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Instance Settings|
	And PortalSettings configure Current Languages CP
		|currentPortalLanguages|Chinese (China),English (United States),French (France)|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And LanguagePortlet view Languages Absent
		|missingLanguages|ARABIC,GERMAN,HUNGARIAN,JAPANESE,PORTUGUESE,SPANISH|
	And LanguagePortlet view Languages Present
		|currentLanguages|CHINESE,FRENCH,ENGLISH|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	Then LanguagePortlet configure View Current Languages
		|currentLanguages|Chinese (China),French (France),English (United States)|
